        <!-- =========================================================
             ABOUT THE PROJECT
        ========================================================== -->
        <section class="about-section project-section" id="project">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-heading reveal">
                    <span class="eyebrow">01 / ABOUT THE PROJECT</span>
                    <h2>More Than Code. <span class="accent-text">Understanding Its Characteristics.</span></h2>
                </div>

                <div class="project-layout">
                    <div class="project-copy reveal">
                        <p>
                            CodeOrigin AI investigates source code characteristics at the
                            repository level rather than relying only on isolated code
                            snippets. Software carries patterns across its files, folders
                            and structure — and those patterns are best examined in context.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            The platform aims to examine patterns across source files and
                            understand characteristics that may be associated with
                            human-written and AI-generated code. It is built as a research
                            platform: observations are presented to support comparison and
                            understanding, not to establish authorship with certainty.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            A repository is more than a collection of files. Its folder
                            structure, naming conventions, configuration choices, comment
                            style and dependency patterns together form a profile of how a
                            project was written and organized. CodeOrigin AI reads that
                            profile at scale, then presents it in a readable, structured way.
                        </p>
                        <a href="#multimodal" class="text-link">
                            Explore the analysis dimensions
                            <i class="bi bi-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </a>
                    </div>

                    <aside class="project-card reveal">
                        <div class="project-card-top">
                            <span class="project-card-icon"><i class="bi bi-boxes" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                            <span class="eyebrow">REPOSITORY CONTEXT</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3>One Repository. Many Signals.</h3>
                        <p>
                            Structure, organization and code style are examined together
                            to produce a broader view of a codebase instead of a single
                            score taken out of context.
                        </p>
                        <div class="project-card-metrics">
                            <div>
                                <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-code" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                <span>SOURCE FILES</span>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <i class="bi bi-diagram-3" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                <span>STRUCTURE</span>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <i class="bi bi-palette" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                <span>STYLE</span>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <i class="bi bi-search" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                <span>SEMANTICS</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </aside>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

