                            <h3>Motivation</h3>
                            <p>Understanding the growing presence of AI-assisted programming and the need to study source code characteristics. As AI tools become part of everyday development, examining how code is written becomes an increasingly relevant research question.</p>
                        </article>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6 reveal">
                        <article class="research-card">
                            <span class="research-icon"><i class="bi bi-folder2-open" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                            <h3>Repository-Level Approach</h3>
                            <p>Examining multiple source files and repository structure instead of depending exclusively on individual snippets. A project's organization carries signals that a single file cannot provide.</p>
