                    <div class="col-md-6 reveal">
                        <article class="research-card">
                            <span class="research-icon"><i class="bi bi-eye" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                            <h3>Explainability</h3>
                            <p>Presenting meaningful observations so users can better understand the analysis. Findings are shown alongside the repository data that produced them, rather than as an unexplained verdict.</p>
                        </article>
                    </div>
                </div>

